+# Stores: rd holds the data, and the address is formed the same way as for
+# loads.  h264_mbloop +0020 supports this - a select performed through memory
+# where `std r16, blank, 0x1dc` is read straight back by
+# `ldd r48, blank, 0x1dc`.
